# MASTER PROMPT — GOOGLE AI STUDIO
## Environmental Intelligence & Compliance Management System

You are an expert full-stack software engineer, AI engineer, UI/UX designer, data analyst, and hackathon-winning product architect.

Build a complete, functional, full-stack web application called **EcoSentinel — Environmental Intelligence & Compliance Management System**.

This project is based on the following problem statement:

"Develop an Environmental Intelligence & Compliance Management System that helps communities, industries and public authorities understand environmental incidents, recognize emerging risks and take informed action. The system should connect environmental observations, predictive insights, applicable standards and incident-management workflows to turn a reported concern into an evidence-backed assessment and a trackable response."

The application must be a working prototype demonstrating the complete journey from environmental incident reporting to AI-powered analysis, compliance assessment, officer investigation, corrective action, and final resolution.

Do not build only a landing page or static dashboard.

Build a real, interactive application with working frontend, backend, database operations, AI integration, analytics, maps, and role-based access.

